								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p align="center"><font face="Georgia" size="5"><em><strong><img style="WIDTH: 41px; HEIGHT: 34px" height="36" src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" width="31" /></strong>&nbsp;<font color="#0000ff">Our Goals</font></em><strong><em> <img style="WIDTH: 41px; HEIGHT: 34px" height="36" src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" width="31" /><br /></em></strong></font></p> <p align="justify"><font face="Georgia"><font face="">Moonlite Redemption was established for the well-seasoned players with the common and innate devotion to helping each other within our ranks.&nbsp; It is, however, encouraged that we help other players in Norrath, especially those with sincere need.&nbsp; We will enjoy EQ to the fullest with a devout sense of family ties within our guild.&nbsp; We have many invidual and group goals, and we shall accomplish those goals as a team.&nbsp; Through questing, raiding, xp grouping, and flagging we will form a kinship that will be loved and honored by all who know us.&nbsp; We will uphold the rules of the land, touch the lives of the many and respect ourselves and others on our search for the righteousness that we will gain out of the battles we forge our friendships upon.<br /></font><em>~Masterfu~</em><br /></p></font><span style="FONT-SIZE: 24pt; COLOR: aquamarine; FONT-FAMILY: 'Bradley Hand ITC'"><font size="3"><span style="COLOR: rgb(51,102,255); FONT-FAMILY: 'Book Antiqua'"><em><span style="FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"> <p class="storysubtitle" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"></span></em></span></font></span><span style="COLOR: rgb(51,102,255); FONT-FAMILY: 'Book Antiqua'"><a href="/forums/message.aspx?mid=115020"><font color="#cccccc"></font></a>&nbsp;</p> <p align="center"><strong><about font="" us=""><em>About Us</em><br /></strong><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1555"><strong><font color="#cccccc">Our Creation<br />The Rathe Games</font></strong></a><br /><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1559"><strong><font color="#cccccc">The Hierachy</font></strong></a><br /><strong><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1600"><font color="#cccccc">Biographies</font></a><br /><a href="/gallery.aspx"><font color="#cccccc">Photo Album</font></a></strong></p></span>
